wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/f5f3c8921a3b352de45446a6789b104458c9f90b\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.338ex;width:1.827ex;height:2.176ex\" /></span> on a set <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4611d85173cd3b508e67077d4a1252c9c05abca2\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.338ex;width:1.499ex;height:2.176ex\" /></span> is, loosely speaking, an operation that takes an element of <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/f5f3c8921a3b352de45446a6789b104458c9f90b\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.338ex;width:1.827ex;height:2.176ex\" /></span> and an element of <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4611d85173cd3b508e67077d4a1252c9c05abca2\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.338ex;width:1.499ex;height:2.176ex\" /></span> and produces another element of <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/23bbb1f0f6ebdfa78b4fed06049640f7386bb44b\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.338ex;width:2.146ex;height:2.176ex\" /></span> More formally, it is a group homomorphism from <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/f5f3c8921a3b352de45446a6789b104458c9f90b\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.338ex;width:1.827ex;height:2.176ex\" /></span> to the automorphism group of <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4611d85173cd3b508e67077d4a1252c9c05abca2\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.338ex;width:1.499ex;height:2.176ex\" /></span>. One says that <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/f5f3c8921a3b352de45446a6789b104458c9f90b\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.338ex;width:1.827ex;height:2.176ex\" /></span> <b>acts</b> on <span class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><img src=\"https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/23bbb1f0f6ebdfa78b4fed06049640f7386bb44b\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align:-0.338ex;width:2.146ex;height:2.176ex\" /></span></p>"}